# 0005: cancelled shell/subagent notices do not resume their owner.
# A cancelled background shell or subagent still records its notice for context, but sends
# resume: false so aborting does not start a fresh model turn; after clearing its marker it
# asks the execution layer to settle a parked waiting owner. Adds regression coverage for
# the cancelled-child settle path. Regenerated against opencode v2.1.4
# (68bc26b7da1990ce10ffecfbc1e09eb13aa5d824).
